 "insight": [
  "The main categories of goods exported and imported by Luxembourg show a trade deficit of 5.89 billion euros in 2025.",
  "The largest deficit is in Mineral fuels and oils, with a negative balance of 2.21 billion euros.",
  "Vehicles and parts follow with a deficit of 1.76 billion euros, and Machinery and mechanical appliances have a deficit of 847.2 million euros.",
  "Pharmaceutical products and Electrical machinery and equipment also contribute to the deficit, with 604.9 million euros and 465.3 million euros respectively.",
  "The data are presented in current euros and include a small portion of confidential values, which are not detailed but accounted for separately."
 ],
